WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Juri starts Drive Impact at close range.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.400
Chun-Li answers with her own Drive Impact.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Standing heavy kick hits the crumpled opponent.

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.050
Serenity Stream medium kick follows the stance entry.

5
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.550
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick finishes the conversion.

6
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.000
Juri recovers after the counter-DI route.
